    "summary": "Glimmer (full) outperforms Trellis-RE on all three test sets, with F1 gains of 3.4 points on Hollin-DocRE (65.2 vs 61.8), 3.6 points on Saltmarsh-Bio (55.9 vs 52.3), and 1.1 points on Wistmoor-News (71.1 vs 70.0).",
